      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.29 (up from ₹1.88 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹42.4b (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.08b (up 303% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.9% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 7.6% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 52% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
